For more information, visit wppmedia.com .

About WPP Media Clients Team:&nbsp; &nbsp;

WPP Media&nbsp;Clients team is a business unit within&nbsp;WPP Media&nbsp;Malaysia&nbsp;that&nbsp;services our&nbsp;local&nbsp;Growth led clients&nbsp;which are&nbsp;performance oriented, need agile team and&nbsp;require&nbsp;fast turnaround operations.&nbsp;The team consists of&nbsp;media specialists&nbsp;that perform a hybrid role cutting&nbsp;across&nbsp;the entire campaign lifecycle, namely&nbsp;end-to-end client engagement, strategic&nbsp;planning&nbsp;and campaign management.&nbsp;&nbsp;

About the Role: &nbsp;

We are looking for a highly motivated Associate, Clients to join the WPP Media Clients Team based out of Malaysia. As an Associate in this team, you should come with about 2-3 years of total work experience in the media industry.&nbsp;

You will be reporting into Associate Director, Clients&nbsp;in this role.&nbsp;

As the primary point of contact for&nbsp;your&nbsp;clients, you will manage their advertising needs end to end across all channels.&nbsp;This&nbsp;includes&nbsp;developing and&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;strong relationships with clients, understanding their business goals, and translating these into effective advertising strategies. You will&nbsp;be required&nbsp;to&nbsp;oversee the entire campaign lifecycle, from&nbsp;initial&nbsp;strategy and planning to setup, execution, and ongoing optimization. Your role is crucial in ensuring that campaigns are delivered on time, within budget, and meet or exceed client expectations. Through meticulous planning&nbsp;and continuous performance analysis, you will drive successful outcomes and deliver exceptional value to our clients.&nbsp;&nbsp;

Key Responsibilities:&nbsp; &nbsp;

Client Relationship &amp; Servicing:&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Client Champion:&nbsp; Communicate with clients, providing regular updates on campaign performance, industry trends, and new opportunities&nbsp;in a timely manner.&nbsp;&nbsp;

• Trusted Advisor:&nbsp; Maintain&nbsp;strong, long-lasting relationships with clients based on trust, transparency, and&nbsp;timely&nbsp;communication.&nbsp;Provide&nbsp;recommendations to help clients achieve their business goals.&nbsp;&nbsp;

• Strategic Insight:&nbsp; Develop an understanding of client businesses, target audiences, competitive landscapes, and industry trends.&nbsp;

Account Management:&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Goal-Oriented Planning:&nbsp; Collaborate with clients to define clear and measurable campaign&nbsp;objectives, aligning advertising strategies with overall business goals.&nbsp;&nbsp;

• Cross-Channel Expertise:&nbsp; Develop comprehensive advertising strategies and media plans across all relevant channels&nbsp;with the guidance of&nbsp;platform experts&nbsp;within your&nbsp;team.&nbsp;&nbsp;

• Campaign&nbsp;Management:&nbsp; Use&nbsp;WPP Media&nbsp;workflow management tool to&nbsp;capture&nbsp;and guide&nbsp;campaign&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;and&nbsp;allocate&nbsp;resources effectively across different channels&nbsp;for effective campaign delivery.&nbsp;&nbsp;

